Devil Room after the current battle.", "INFO_POS_STAT_LOCAL_ISAAC_ANGEL_ROOM_CHANCE", "Chance for an Angel Room after the current battle.", "INFO_NEG_STAT_LOCAL_ISAAC_ANGEL_ROOM_CHANCE", "Chance for an Angel Room after the current battle.", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_DIVINE_BARRIER", "Divine Barrier", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_EUCHARIST", "Eucharist", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_BLOOD_OF_MARTYR", "Blood of the Martyr", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_HALO", "Halo", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_JESUS_JUICE", "Jesus Juice", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_GUARDIAN_ANGEL", "Guardian Angel", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_DIVINE_BARRIER", "Gain {1} Divine Barrier charge every {0} seconds. Each charge blocks one hit, has no time limit, and can accumulate during the wave.", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_EUCHARIST", "Angel Room appearance chance is fixed at {0}% after its scheduled waves.", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_GUARDIAN_ANGEL", "Spawns an orbiting Guardian Angel that blocks enemy projectiles.\nProjectile-blocking orbitals rotate {0}% faster.", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_GOAT_HEAD", "Goat Head", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_DUALITY", "Duality", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_SIN_TWINS", "Sin Twins", "ITEM_LOCAL_ISAAC_BLOODY_GUST", "Bloody Gust", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_GOAT_HEAD", "Devil Rooms always appear after their scheduled waves.", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_DUALITY", "When a special room appears, both Devil and Angel Rooms open. Entering either closes the other.", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_SIN_TWINS", "Spawns two orbiting Sin Twins that copy your strongest weapon, each dealing {0}% damage.", "EFFECT_LOCAL_ISAAC_BLOODY_GUST", "Taking damage grants +{0}%{3} and +{1}%{4} for this wave, up to {2} stacks." )
